    "rationale": "Receipt e35d85aad0014523859875ee2262bc43 (completed, exit 0, 57 parsed events) exercised the post-healing election phase, and the comparison for the flag-enabled case is violated at parsed index 51 while its flag-disabled control holds at 56. I register that as a fact: shutting down the instance that led the healed cluster and allowing a further election did not reconcile the two sides' committed content, so a later term is not the path by which the divergence ends. The mechanism is the term-only truncation comparison already recorded in 43773fedb67847ecb3c0a7a9adaa54a2-knowledge-0.",
